### Base URL local
@base=http://localhost:8080

### Listar
GET {{base}}/api/tasks

### Crear
POST {{base}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Tarea via HTTP file",
  "completed": false
}

### Actualizar (reemplazar {id})
PUT {{base}}/api/tasks/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Actualizada",
  "completed": true
}

### Eliminar (reemplazar {id})
DELETE {{base}}/api/tasks/{{id}}

### Swagger UI
GET {{base}}/docs
